        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Gnrh1 (Mmus) expressing hypothalamic gonadotropin-releasing hormone neuron of brain (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>hypothalamic gonadotropin-releasing hormone neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
