        <obo:IAO_0000028>cerebellar astrocyte (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transcriptomically defined type of astrocyte localized exclusively in the cerebellum beneath the Purkinje cell layer. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dao (Mmus), Efemp1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5207 Astro-CB NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
