        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-NT NN_1 Slc36a2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gfap (Mmus), Slc36a2 (Mmus), Sfrp5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_1 cells by expression of Slc36a2, Sfrp5. These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5209 Astro-NT NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
