        <owl:annotatedTarget>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Agt (Mmus), Prss35 (Mmus), C4b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_1 cells by expression of Kcnk10, C4b. These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: arbor vitae . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5212 Astro-NT NN_1.</owl:annotatedTarget>
