        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-NT NN_1 Mecom (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dao (Mmus), Mecom (Mmus), Fbln5 (Mmus), Prelp (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_1 cells by expression of Mecom, Prelp. These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: Ventral cochlear nucleus, Paraflocculus, Flocculus, Dorsal cochlear nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5213 Astro-NT NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5213 Astro-NT NN_1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Dao (Mmus), Mecom (Mmus), Fbln5 (Mmus), Prelp (Mmus) expressing astrocyte of brain (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Astro-NT NN_1 Mecom astrocyte (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
