        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-TE NN_1 Myoc (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Myoc (Mmus), Lhx2 (Mmus), Kcne1l (Mmus), Alpk1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-TE NN_1 cells by expression of Myoc, Kcne1l, Alpk1. These cells are located in the Isocortex, Olfactory areas, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5218 Astro-TE NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
