        <owl:annotatedTarget>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of S1pr1 (Mmus), Fam163a (Mmus), Kcnq3 (Mmus), Kcnq1ot1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-TE NN_3 cells by expression of Fam163a, Nr2f1, Kcnq1ot1. These cells are located in the Isocortex, Olfactory areas . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5225 Astro-TE NN_3.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
