        <obo:IAO_0000028>Tanycyte NN_2 Otx2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tanycyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ccdc146 (Mmus), Tbx3 (Mmus), Otx2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Tanycyte NN_2 cells by expression of Otx2, Nkx2-4. These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, posterior part, third ventricle . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5248 Tanycyte NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
