        <obo:IAO_0000028>CHOR NN_1 Slc17a8 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A choroid plexus epithelial cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 2900040C04Rik (Mmus), Slc17a8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CHOR NN cells by expression of Slc17a8. It is glutamatergic. These cells are located in the brain , in or close to the regions: choroid plexus, lateral ventricle . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5265 CHOR NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
