        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A mature myelinating oligodendrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cldn11 (Mmus), A230001M10Rik (Mmus), Spock3 (Mmus), Rhoj (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MOL NN_4 cells by expression of Spock3, Rhoj. These cells are located in the Midbrain, Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5285 MOL NN_4.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
