        <owl:annotatedTarget>A mature myelinating oligodendrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Mog (Mmus), Anln (Mmus), Gm32633 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MOL NN_4 cells by expression of Sspo, Selenop. These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5288 MOL NN_4.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
